ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261006/202610060228363955_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261006/202610060228363955_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-06/match1949575date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">替补连入4球翻盘！法国4-1逆转比利时 奥利塞2射1传、杜埃1射2传</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261006/zhanbao_image_1949575_1791233104_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261006/zhanbao_image_1949575_1791233104_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261006/zhanbao_image_1949575_1791233104_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>奥利塞2射1传，杜埃2传1射，法国替补连入4球4-1逆转比利时，齐达内上任4场3胜1平不败。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-06/match1949576date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">意大利3-1送土耳其欧国联四连败 皮奥破门卡拉菲奥里处子球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.61" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261006/zhanbao_image_1949576_1791233697_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="I